  "ApprovalBasis": "Limited ACCEPT for this exact revision-3 Trial prepared content: source provenance, CSV/generated mapping, decoded/resolved field mapping, geometry and exact-parameter evidence under the existing ContentReviewEvidence SchemaVersion1 contract. This is not whole CH1-IMPL-001 acceptance. QA independently read all 64 source references and matched their SHA256 values; 17 author CSV and 17 generated JSON files match the frozen review-candidate-05 and prepare inputs. Author set SHA256 867a9ab630e8d6d6201fe3d5d8b71c8db4cdec016c5b348967242523eebf7462; generated set c7c034446902183a407d3a7c0a763d671d1af84476e9c63890ad8e6644201bb4. Reviewed 16 levels, 17 faces, 47 enemies, 20 action rows and 208 route cells, including endpoint coordinate conversion, bounds, adjacency and nonintersection; normal progression, reward/material separation, first-clear cards and certificate, one-time level-16 teaching gift and skill cost, exact enemy cycles/Wind/core vulnerability match the author tables. DecodedSource equals source-copy; resolved levels, rewards, growth, inventory and progression match with content contexts; sorted capability sets, targeting enum names, ordered item rows and numeric cooldown conversion are explicit. NewProfile and all 31 PRD parameter inputs equal the original seed; all 31 evidence rows are within proposed tolerance. Validation binds chapter-evidence SHA256 e5c44a012ebb2a67b4369b9afd731cdb074d3000c75f58071cf8a31b193466cd. Original prepare was performed by the actual C author thread/turn recorded here, exit0 in15.277029seconds, 134 candidate/600 input/44 protected files matched; its8 outputs remain unchanged. Source review: PR27 head936f2b173fde52327c2d17f1ab6dd3391f69da69, independent GitHub receipt https://github.com/yyczz1/FightMatch/pull/27#issuecomment-6394590011 and state6394230892 completed with no findings or unresolved findings; reviewed base7a226936751ab265609b0fdc751207648bdffffb. Earlier PR24/PR25 scoped acceptance remains separate. Existing96 distinct XML cases, one complete Boss UTP End/Success, four P2/navigation UI passes, and the final matching teaching helper test1/1 are retained at their exact frozen inputs; no clean published-tree full run is asserted. PR26 independent final review remains unavailable and is not covered by PR27. BattleReplayPerformed=false and PublicationInvoked=false are preserved. Actual-r3 end-to-end gameplay, actual r3 Publish/activate/six-file cold load/resource outputs, Scene/Play, device presentation, author balance acceptance, final balancing and V4-to-V5 migration are outside this approval and require their own applicable receipts. This record provides only the prepared Trial content gate; it does not execute or authorize broader publication, deployment or release.",
